---
description: ChorusDraft development lock and PR rules for agents
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow CONTRIBUTING.md and AGENTS.md.

Desktop lock (one open PR only): `desktop/src/main.jsx`,
`desktop/electron/main.cjs`, `launcher/bridge.py`. If another open PR
touches those files, stop. Do not open a second PR. Do not stack on an
unmerged lock PR.

Issues and PRs: short, no checklists or agent notes, `Fixes #N`. Do not
file extra issues. Do not merge/close/duplicate an open PR for the same
work. Do not bump VERSION or cut a release unless asked.

At most two open PRs; at most one desktop-lock PR. Sign commits with the
environment default.
